 "limits": "Pairs that share no blocking key are never compared, so weak blocking misses duplicates. Edit distance uses the first 200 characters. Similarity weights and thresholds are judgment; tune them on a labelled sample. Clusters chain pairs, so A like B and B like C puts A and C together even when A and C differ. The helper never merges records; it only proposes.",
